	(text "Pi 4 J3 (CAMERA) pinout, 1:1 with Camera Module v2.1:\n1 GND  2 D0N  3 D0P  4 GND  5 D1N(nc)  6 D1P(nc)  7 GND\n8 CLKN  9 CLKP  10 GND  11 CAM_GPIO  12 nc  13 SCL0  14 SDA0  15 3V3\nI2C on Pi 4 = GPIO44/45 (i2c_csi_dsi); pull-ups to 3V3 exist on the Pi."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "634cbcb3-e71a-4c3e-8875-6ad5870233da")
	)
	(text "Reset / power-down / address\nOverlay adv728x-m sets no reset/powerdown GPIO and does not enable cam1_reg,\nso RESET and PWRDWN are pulled up on board; JP2/JP3 optionally route CAM_GPIO (Pi pin 11).\nALSB=1 -> 7-bit addr 0x21 as in adv7282m-overlay.dts (reg = <0x21>). Close JP1 for 0x20."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 240.03 44.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "23a58461-7b2f-444e-9b95-464762c74434")
	)
	(text "Power: 3.3 V from Pi camera connector (pin 15). Two AP2112K-1.8 LDOs:\nU2 -> DVDD+MVDD (~84 mA typ), U3 -> AVDD (~47 mA) and PVDD via FB1 (~12 mA).\nUG-637 recommends separate regulated supplies for the analog/PLL group."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55.88 254 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6aeb9071-6105-4d40-babf-e3bb7dfc1157")
	)
